### PF4J 插件系统测试脚本
### 使用 IDEA HTTP Client 执行测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### ================================
### 模块 1: 插件生命周期 API 测试
### ================================

### TC-1.1 扫描插件目录
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/rescan

###

### TC-1.2 获取插件列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/list

###

### TC-1.3 获取插件详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/info/demo-plugin

###

### TC-1.4 停止插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/stop/demo-plugin

###

### TC-1.5 启动插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/start/demo-plugin

###

### TC-1.6 重载插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/reload/demo-plugin

###

### TC-1.7 卸载插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/uninstall/demo-plugin

###

### ================================
### 模块 2: 运行态与治理 API
### ================================

### TC-2.1 初始化同步插件数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/init-sync

###

### TC-2.2 运行态总览
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/runtime/summary

###

### TC-2.3 插件运行态详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/runtime/demo-plugin

###

### TC-2.4 扫描新插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/scan-new

###

### TC-2.5 同步插件入库
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/sync

###

### TC-2.6 插件对齐 DryRun
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dryRun": true
}

###

### TC-2.7 启用插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/enable/demo-plugin

###

### TC-2.8 禁用插件
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/disable/demo-plugin

###

### TC-2.9 插件健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/health/demo-plugin

###

### TC-2.10 审计日志查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/audit/list?limit=50&pluginId=demo-plugin&action=start

###

### ================================
### 模块 3: 安装入口统一（install）
### ================================

### TC-3.1 统一安装 - 本地路径
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/install
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "LOCAL_PATH",
  "jarPath": "D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/magic-plugin-zintis-led.jar"
}

###

### TC-3.2 统一安装 - 远程 URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/install
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "REMOTE_URL",
  "url": "https://example.com/magic-plugin-demo.jar"
}

###

### ================================
### 模块 4: 上传安装（upload）
### ================================

### TC-4.1 上传并安装插件（仅文件上传）
POST {{baseUrl}}/plugin/admin/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="magic-plugin-demo.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< D:/IdeaProjects/magic-boot/plugins/magic-plugin-demo.zip
--WebAppBoundary--

###
